   920	\begin{theorem}[split counting; ratio form of the Dixon--Pomerance lemma]\label{thm:S}
   921	Let $Y'\ge2$ with $2Y'^2<N$, and let $\cS\subset[Y'/2,Y']\cap\Z$ consist of integers coprime to $N$. Then
