  1131	The coefficient vector $c$ enters $F_A(P)$ only through $\langle c,v(P)\rangle$. The next lemma replaces Lee and
  1132	Venkatesan's Lemmas~5.13, 5.18 and~5.20 \cite{lv2018} by a short self-contained argument.
