  1259	$|\Psi(x;t,r)-\Psi_t(x)/\varphi(t)|>\Psi_t(x)/(2\varphi(t))\ge\Psi(x)/(3t)\ge\Psi(x)/(3Q)$, by Fact~\ref{fact:Ten}. Sum
