  1975	basis. It keeps exactly the points of $\cP_\ell\cap\Lambda_\ell(g)\cap[-V,V]^2$ with $G(P)\ne0$, $F_A(P)\ne0$ and $|G(P)|\ge MV/32$. Every counted point is
  1976	kept, and its gcd checks pass (its values are coprime to $N$). Step~3 computes all smooth parts exactly (Lemma~\ref{lem:BS}). So step~4 returns
  1977	a counted point whenever one exists, and only counted points. Lemma~\ref{lem:BS} applies with $b=O(B+S^2\log N)$, since every value has
  1978	$O(\log N)$ bits (Lemma~\ref{lem:valuesizes}). Trial division of the two chosen values costs $\tilde O(B)$.
